    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the body\u2019s defense system in this fast-paced action shooter. Step into the role of a powerful immune cell and use precise touch controls to target and eliminate waves of invading bacteria and viruses. Strategically choose your character, complete challenging levels, upgrade your abilities, and defend vital organs from infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive gameplay, satisfying progression, and escalating challenges, the battle for survival begins at the cellular level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 3 Unique Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 3 Game Modes Story, Hardcore, and Endless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Story Mode: A casual, easy-paced experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Hardcore Mode: For players seeking a real challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Endless Mode: One Life, survive as long as you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5 Distinct Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 23+ Upgrades and Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5 Epic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Global Leaderboards\u2014 compete for the top spot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the body\u2019s defense system in this fast-paced action shooter. Step into the role of a powerful immune cell and use precise touch controls to target and eliminate waves of invading bacteria and viruses. Strategically choose your character, complete challenging levels, upgrade your abilities, and defend vital organs from infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive gameplay, satisfying progression, and escalating challenges, the battle for survival begins at the cellular level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 3 Unique Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 3 Game Modes Story, Hardcore, and Endless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Story Mode: A casual, easy-paced experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Hardcore Mode: For players seeking a real challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u25cf Endless Mode: One Life, survive as long as you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5 Distinct Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 23+ Upgrades and Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5 Epic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Global Leaderboards\u2014 compete for the top spot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
